      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0",
      "artist": "Ken Bagnall",
      "description": "Cricieth/Criccieth - Min-y-Traeth Cricieth/Criccieth is located in Eifionydd on the Cardigan Bay shore of the Llŷn Peninsula. The town is south facing and built around the rocky outcrop containing Castell Cricieth/Criccieth Castle, which effectively divides the shoreline in two at this point.  The East Shore has a sandy beach with a shallow area for bathing.",
